NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000654 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000655 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000656 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000657 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000658 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000659 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000660 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000661 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000662 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000663 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000664 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000665 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000666 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000667 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000668 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000669 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000670 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000671 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000672 ""
